{"v":1,"id":"06987b96329f","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"I spent so many years saying, “When”","s":12.69,"e":17.26},{"t":"When I am stronger","s":17.29,"e":18.75},{"t":"When I have changed","s":18.79,"e":20.27},{"t":"When I have earned the right to come","s":20.31,"e":24.81},{"t":"I kept tomorrow like a doorway","s":24.89,"e":29.22},{"t":"And made today a place to hide","s":29.27,"e":35.59},{"t":"Like I was only passing through","s":35.62,"e":37.69},{"t":"With my heart divided inside","s":37.7,"e":48.77},{"t":"But every morning came with mercy","s":48.81,"e":55.05},{"t":"Every breath was borrowed grace","s":55.13,"e":60.65},{"t":"And still Your voice was calling softly","s":60.7,"e":65.44},{"t":"“Turn around and seek My face”","s":62.97,"e":72.86},{"t":"I kept waiting for the answer","s":72.88,"e":78.89},{"t":"Certain I would know the sound","s":78.96,"e":84.81},{"t":"Then I heard You in the silence…","s":84.85,"e":89.46},{"t":"“Why wait","s":86.9,"e":91.36},{"t":"When I am here right now?”","s":91.4,"e":94.88},{"t":"If I knew then what I know now","s":94.89,"e":98.91},{"t":"I’d still fall down, I’d still arise","s":98.94,"e":106.55},{"t":"Still bring my wounds","s":106.61,"e":109.5},{"t":"Still learn the truth","s":109.56,"e":112.38},{"t":"Still lay my old life aside","s":112.4,"e":118.23},{"t":"But I would stop running","s":118.26,"e":120.96},{"t":"From the light within Your gaze","s":121.0,"e":124.11},{"t":"’Cause while I was waiting","s":122.73,"e":126.88},{"t":"For the day that I would finally change…","s":126.93,"e":134.08},{"t":"You were calling me","s":134.12,"e":139.03},{"t":"To walk with You today","s":139.09,"e":146.66},{"t":"I thought peace was somewhere distant","s":146.66,"e":147.98},{"t":"A finish line ahead","s":148.0,"e":157.44},{"t":"Where the war inside my spirit","s":157.45,"e":158.24},{"t":"Would finally leave my mind and rest","s":158.25,"e":164.36},{"t":"Instead…","s":164.44,"e":165.04},{"t":"You met me in the ordinary","s":165.08,"e":168.55},{"t":"In the breaking of my pride","s":168.61,"e":170.94},{"t":"In every moment I surrendered","s":171.0,"e":174.26},{"t":"What I could no longer hide","s":174.3,"e":177.15},{"t":"I was chasing after answers","s":177.21,"e":180.42},{"t":"Trying hard to make me whole","s":180.47,"e":183.03},{"t":"Never seeing that repentance","s":183.11,"e":186.13},{"t":"Was the doorway to my soul","s":186.16,"e":187.98},{"t":"No one tells you…","s":187.99,"e":194.64},{"t":"The moments Heaven uses most","s":194.68,"e":199.76},{"t":"May come without a warning","s":199.82,"e":204.83},{"t":"If I knew then what I know now","s":204.84,"e":210.66},{"t":"I’d still fall down, I’d still arise","s":210.72,"e":214.59},{"t":"Still bring my wounds","s":214.62,"e":217.52},{"t":"Still learn the truth","s":217.53,"e":222.3},{"t":"Still lay my old life aside","s":222.34,"e":227.97},{"t":"But I would stop running","s":228.02,"e":230.66},{"t":"From the light within Your gaze","s":230.7,"e":233.79},{"t":"’Cause while I was waiting","s":232.36,"e":236.55},{"t":"For the day that I would finally change…","s":236.59,"e":243.55},{"t":"You were calling me","s":243.59,"e":248.5},{"t":"To walk with You today","s":248.56,"e":261.34},{"t":"Hey…","s":261.38,"e":261.9},{"t":"You do not need another mask to wear","s":261.94,"e":264.7},{"t":"You do not need the world’s permission","s":264.77,"e":267.65},{"t":"You do not have to save yourself","s":267.72,"e":270.5},{"t":"Before you come and listen","s":270.55,"e":272.97},{"t":"The narrow way is not a distant road","s":273.02,"e":276.08},{"t":"For someone else to find","s":276.13,"e":277.7},{"t":"It begins when you stop defending","s":277.72,"e":278.72},{"t":"Everything You’re asking God to bind","s":278.81,"e":289.72},{"t":"This…","s":289.82,"e":291.49},{"t":"This is the hour","s":291.52,"e":294.45},{"t":"To turn your heart","s":294.51,"e":297.61},{"t":"To let the old self die","s":297.65,"e":303.27},{"t":"To take up your cross","s":303.31,"e":304.99},{"t":"To follow truth","s":305.05,"e":305.86},{"t":"And stop waiting","s":305.87,"e":306.58},{"t":"To become alive","s":306.6,"e":313.9},{"t":"If I knew then what I know now","s":313.91,"e":319.33},{"t":"I would not lift tomorrow so high","s":319.39,"e":325.82},{"t":"I would have bowed a little sooner","s":325.93,"e":330.7},{"t":"Before another day passed by","s":330.77,"e":333.94},{"t":"Not because the road was easy","s":333.96,"e":335.54},{"t":"Not because I understood","s":335.63,"e":344.07},{"t":"But because Your voice was present","s":344.17,"e":346.9},{"t":"Calling all things back to good","s":346.97,"e":349.6},{"t":"I kept waiting","s":349.71,"e":352.76},{"t":"For my life to start","s":352.8,"e":355.48},{"t":"Never knowing…","s":355.57,"e":358.92},{"t":"You were standing at the door","s":358.96,"e":361.36},{"t":"Of my heart","s":361.44,"e":363.57},{"t":"The life was happening","s":363.61,"e":367.47},{"t":"When I answered","s":367.5,"e":368.94},{"t":"When I turned","s":368.98,"e":369.6},{"t":"When I followed You","s":369.61,"e":378.37},{"t":"I spent my whole life","s":378.4,"e":383.12},{"t":"Waiting for the story to start","s":383.19,"e":389.6},{"t":"Then I heard You say…","s":389.64,"e":394.43},{"t":"“Come out from among them","s":391.62,"e":396.24},{"t":"And walk with Me”","s":396.29,"e":397.67},{"t":"Turns out…","s":397.7,"e":403.52},{"t":"The chapter I was searching for","s":403.56,"e":407.96},{"t":"Began the moment","s":408.01,"e":409.44},{"t":"I believed","s":409.55,"e":412.45},{"t":"And obeyed","s":412.55,"e":413.3}],"match":null}
